full_text:
we asked computer to animate itself. it understood the assignment.

@RypeArts designed the logo and I couldn't stop seeing the eyes move. so I got curious...what if Computer animated its own states at different sizes and provide motion principles and easing curves?

very fun rounds of iteration later, this is what happens when the tool becomes part of the process. now it's baked right into the product.

Agency is a muscle. 

Tools can strengthen it — or let it atrophy.

@ivanhzhao https://t.co/vIC3boZ7iS
